      "id": "M1",
      "description": "Each round has a shop phase where the player buys creatures from a randomized shop using gold. Creatures can be placed on a board (limited slots) or held on a bench. Selling creatures refunds partial gold. A timer or ready button transitions to the fight phase. Score 0 if there is no shop, if creatures cannot be bought/sold, or if there is no board placement. Score 1 requires the mechanic to be presented in a visually authored context with real sprites or illustrated assets. Score 0.5 at most if the mechanic works but is represented entirely by programmatic shapes, solid-color fills, or default Godot widgets.",
