      "description": "Combat is automatic: placed creatures fight the opponent's creatures without player input. Creatures attack in order, targeting the nearest enemy. Abilities trigger based on conditions (on-attack, on-death, start-of-combat). Health bars deplete and creatures die when health reaches zero. Score 0 if combat requires player input, if there are no abilities, or if health is not tracked. Score 1 requires the mechanic to be presented in a visually authored context with real sprites or illustrated assets. Score 0.5 at most if the mechanic works but is represented entirely by programmatic shapes, solid-color fills, or default Godot widgets.",
