      "description": "The player has a health pool that depletes when they lose a round (damage proportional to surviving enemy creatures). Last player standing wins. An elimination format with at least 4 AI opponents creates escalating pressure. A placement screen shows final ranking. Score 0 if there is no player health, if losing has no consequence, or if there is no elimination format. Score 1 requires the mechanic to be presented in a visually authored context with real sprites or illustrated assets. Score 0.5 at most if the mechanic works but is represented entirely by programmatic shapes, solid-color fills, or default Godot widgets.",
