      "description": "At least 15 distinct creature types with different stats, abilities, tribes, and visual designs. Creatures range from cheap fodder to expensive powerhouses. Each creature has a unique sprite and name. Score 0 if there are fewer than 15 creatures, if they share identical stats, or if they have no unique art. Score 1 requires content variants to be visually distinct with real authored art (different sprites, illustrated elements). Score 0.5 at most if variants exist but are represented by programmatic shapes, color swaps, or text labels without real asset differences.",
